title: Capital for Investment
subtitle: Treasury or Industry: how the credit instrument is financed.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_investment.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'investment_fund') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.investment_fund (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.5). Opening and closing
// the card are free; a confirmed option costs this month's action, or the one free step of an adviser
// who opened the card. Options that need a system of a later stage are shown with their reason.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'investment_fund');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_investment');
!}

= Capital for investment

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

The credit instrument costs 1 B a month from its launch and raises the credit target after two months, for as long as it works (+5). The variants differ in who pays and who must agree: one financing, one cost, one effect.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[+ pl_gc_projects +]

- @public
- @banks
- @cooperative
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@public
title: Public fund
subtitle: The state pays everything: 1 budget unit a month.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'investment_fund', 'public').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_investment_fund_public_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'investment_fund', 'public');
!}
go-to: result

@banks
title: Agreement with banks and industry
subtitle: The banks share the risk: 1 budget unit a month; business pressure falls (−8). Needs credit of at least 40.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'investment_fund', 'banks').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_investment_fund_banks_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'investment_fund', 'banks');
!}
go-to: result

@cooperative
title: Cooperative financing
subtitle: Credit for farms and small workshops through the cooperatives: 1 budget unit a month.
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'investment_fund', 'cooperative').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_investment_fund_cooperative_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'investment_fund', 'cooperative');
!}
go-to: result

@result
